Subject: [PATCH 131/230] fix(profile): keep auth session when resetting local
 data
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The reset sheet was wiping matchday.session (the auth token) along with
everything else, so the user would be signed out after resetting. Add
matchday.session to the keep set. Also verify: toast now shows
"Local data cleared" after reset.

